window.products.push({"id":324053,"name":"Ceramic Pyramid Coffee Dripper Dark Blue with Hemp Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AfTW2qnfL.jpg","description":"Did they even drink coffee in ancient Egypt? Well actually, not as far as we know. They drank a lot of beer. Perhaps the pyramids would have been built a bit faster if they had beat Kaldi to the punch? Either way, let’s not downplay the fact that the Egyptian pyramids are still shrouded in mystery thousands of years after their construction. We set out to create a dripper that harnessed some of the mysticism of ancient Egypt. Whether or not you believe that a pyramid can mummify a cat, keep food fresh or sharpen your razor blades...Rest assured, it can help you make amazing coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AfTW2qnfL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flat White","source_asin":"B07K8SQ32V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K8SQ32V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K8SQ32V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
