window.products.push({"id":324109,"name":"New York Firefighters Raising Flag 9/11 NYC 8x10 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ULnYyb2QL._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTION9/11 photo of FDNY firefighters raising the flag at Ground Zero. The picture, captured by Thomas E. Franklin of the Record, shows three New York City firefighters raising the U.S. flag at Ground Zero of the World Trade Center, following the attacks of September 11, 2001.PHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Printed Under License by An American Place / The McMahan Photo Archive, Copyright 2001 The Record (Bergen N.J.) via Getty Images, Photo by Thomas E. Franklin PHOTO IMAGE DATE: 2001IMAGE ID: AADS012ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ULnYyb2QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B0041626I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0041626I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0041626I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
