window.products.push({"id":324211,"name":"Striludo Culinary Kitchen Butane Torch, Creme Brulee Torch, Blow Torch for Cooking, Adjustable Flame with Reverse Use（Butane Gas Not Included）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FpvoRwdUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safe and Convenient Fuel Sous Vide Torch: There is ergonomic master trigger for quick ignition. Our gun lighter quality is strictly controlled, and the butane torches have passed more than 10,000 ignition tests before leaving factory. Adjustable Firepower: with an adjustment knob, flame size of the butane torch lighter for dabs can be adjusted to big and small to meet various using scenarios. Temperature can reach to 1300°C / 2500°F Can be used inverted. Customers can rotate the minecraft torch 360 degrees according to actual needs. Tips: Do not invert the lighter torch for cooking until a few seconds after ignition. With universal card-type interface to connect to butane gas canister, no need to inflate the grillblazer grill gun. Install the culinary torch head when needed, unscrew the gun body from the gas tank when not needed. The creme brulee torch is no air leakage, easy to operate. Long service life: The bbq torch has a built-in copper and is equipped with a heat-insulating ceramic ring. This design helps stabilize the flame, making the fireplace lighter last longer. With a threaded knob in the middle of the food grade blazer torch to adjust the hardness of the flame. Spit fires can be used for dehairing meat, grilling, and roasting meat; soft fires can be used for pastry baking, and dish cooking. Our solar torch lighter are perfect for roasting and charring vegetables, glazing ham, browning and crisping toppings, melting cheese and of course producing the sugary crust on crème Brulee, meringues and pastries Note: Butane Gas Not Included Exceptional Value - Every Striludo big shot torch comes with a 1-year replacement warranty and friendly customer service by Striludo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FpvoRwdUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Striludo","source_asin":"B0BMV3RDZV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMV3RDZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMV3RDZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
