window.products.push({"id":324219,"name":"Bradford The Exchange Everlasting Love Swan Musical Trinket Box by Lena Liu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mLoc2fUKL._AC_SL1006_.jpg","description":"Hall-of-Fame artist Lena Liu’s vision of two graceful swans gliding upon the reflective surface of a serene lake has long been one of her most admired pieces, symbolizing lifelong devotion and romantic love. Now it becomes the centerpiece of a lustrous Heirloom Porcelain footed music box enhanced with gleaming 22K gold highlights. More of Lena’s floral art adorns the lid, which features a metallic topper containing a single, faceted faux jewel. More jewels adorn the scalloped edge of the music box, which plays “Lover’s Concerto” at the turn of a key.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mLoc2fUKL._AC_SL1006_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B015XZ297I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015XZ297I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015XZ297I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
