window.products.push({"id":324224,"name":"Home Queen Stretch Jacquard Sofa Covers, 4-Piece Non-Slip Stripes Couch Slipcover, Furniture Covers for Dogs, Kids, Pets (Recliner, Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDFUk7YPL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Elastic High Elastic and Superior Fabric: Recliner size is suitable for sofa length between 24\"-32\". Home Queen elastic sofa covers are made of remarkable high stretchy fabric (85% Polyester/15% Spandex ) which is durable and breathable, ensure the fitted slip cover cover your sofa in a tightly knit way without wrinkle and make it both good function and comfortable. Perfect companion to many types sofa, gives your sofa a brand new look and the good quality finishing will withstand years of use. Brand New Pattern: Upgraded pattern makes your sofa look more attractive and tasteful. When you sit or lie on the sofa, the thick and smooth faric woven by Jacquard Technique will provide you completely wonderful touch experience. Protect your sofa in all directions well with elasticized bottom and with modern and out stand looking, it's also an ideal gift choice to your friends. Non Skid Stays in Place: Our sofa slipcover are stretchy to fit various types of sofa. It's not big or saggy, and it won't look like a couch covered by a couch cover, it will look like a brand new couch. No matter kids or pets hop on it, it will not budged. Easy Care: Use our sofa cover, it will protect your sofa from daily dirt. It's not waterproof but it will keep your sofa safe from daily wear and tear. Not dirty easily, machine washable, high quality fabric is fadeless and pilling resistance, delicate cycle with mild detergent, do not bleach and hang dry. Buy with Confidence - Feel confident buying this product knowing we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDFUk7YPL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Queen","source_asin":"B07QQRPZSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QQRPZSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QQRPZSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
