window.products.push({"id":324235,"name":"Vphom Corner Shower Caddy, Adhesive Shower Rack Organizer with Soap Dish & Hooks, No Drilling Rustproof Black Shower Shelf for Bathroom, Toilet, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pfb8cm-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Save Space & Large Storage Capacity】- This hanging shower storage rack is 12.5 x 5.2 x 1.85 inch, bigger than most of the shower shelves on the market. You'll get extra space to stash shampoo, body wash, facial cream, shaving cream, towels, bath balls, toothpaste, mouthwash cup, facial cleanser, aromatherapy and etc. The fence can prevents items from falling. The extra 3 activity hooks, and soap dish offers a space for your soaps and sponge, keeps everything organized. 【Drain Fast & Rust-Proof】- The unique hollow out design can drain fast and keeps your bath products clean and dry. Our shower racks, soap dishes and hooks are made of high-quality space aluminum, waterproof, moisture-proof, rust-proof, non-fading and durable. 【Powerful Adhesive & Strong Load Bearing】- No deformation, No falling. Strong self-adhesive patch, strong adhesion, can withstand up to 15-20 pounds of weight, providing super stability. The bathroom shower shelf can still maintain balance without wobbling or falling at any time even after months of use. 【Easy to Install & Adjustable Distance 】- No tools or drilling. Our bathroom storage organizer is ​equipped with adhesives. Just tear off the protective film of adhesive and then stick it to a clean surface (making sure adhesives are consistent in height and press firmly to squeeze the air out), and then attach the black shower caddy, waiting for 24 hrs put your bathroom shower accessories on the shelve. It’s able to install the shower shelves separately and customize the height between them. 【Multi-functional Shower Storage Rack: Practical & Beautiful 】- No traceless adhesive bathroom storage organizer, toiletries storage rack ,rustproof food storage basket, 4-in-1 Kitchen Spice Racks and etc. Perfect wall mounted hanging basket great storage for bathroom, toilet, kitchen, bedroom. It's very easy to stick to a non-textured smooth surface on tile, marble, glass, wood, metal. Save space and keep tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pfb8cm-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vphom","source_asin":"B09LXFWHF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LXFWHF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LXFWHF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
