window.products.push({"id":324280,"name":"Rice Dispenser Container Cereal Bean Storage Bin Kitchen Organizer Flour Storage Sealed Box With Each Dispensing 150gram(1 CUPS)-12kgs 26.5 lb Capacit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nO8OnMuuL._AC_.jpg","description":"What is a Rice Dispenser Many problems can be found when it comes to storing rice, some of which are: Keeping rice fresh, tidily having rice stored, storing rice in bulk, having easy access, using old rice first, keeping pests away etc. There are even more problems which can be found but with use of a simple product such as a rice dispenser all these problems can be flushed away. Rice Dispensers are small units for holding and storing rice wherever you wish to place them. Not only does it allow you to store rice, it manages your rice. They are designed to keep rice dry, fresh and insect free while giving easy access to grab 1 cup of rice with one press of a button or one pull of a drawer. Plus a major advantage with any rice dispenser unit is that you can easily top up rice without having to worry about the old rice being used first! (Major benefit compared to storing rice in a plastic container) Features: Capacity– Holds up to 26.5 pounds(12kgs) of rice Color– Red /Transparent Dispensing Quantities–1 cup /150 grams / 5.3 oz Slim and lightweight rice dispenser which holds the capacity for just over 26.5 pounds of rice. Places nicely into any kitchen and even cupboard. Easy to view how much rice is left to know when more rice is required to be topped up.Ease of dispensing the rice makes it worthwhile as every push you know you are getting one cup of rice. Also could be use for store more dry food like flours, beans,spice, and pet foods... A multifunctional foods storage container good in your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nO8OnMuuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"i Kito","source_asin":"B07SS2DJ1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS2DJ1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SS2DJ1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
