window.products.push({"id":324332,"name":"HOMEIDEAS Bathroom Rugs Light Blue, Non-Slip Carpet for Tub Bathroom Shower Mat with Rug Pad, 2X Absorbent Chenille Bath Rug, 20\"x 32\", 0.4\" Thicker P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HFICzAEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚿2 TIMES WATER ABSORBENCY - Homeideas grey bathroom rug is higher absorbency than other grey chenille bath rug for bathroom thanks to each microfiber pile is 0.4\" thickness piles. Thick Chenille fabric helps your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Spruce up your bathroom for maximum serenity and warmth. 🚿EXTREA SOFT & THICK & SHAGGY - The microfiber bath mat shag is much thicker than other ordinary chenille rugs. Our extra shaggy rugs protect your feet from cold bathroom floor, especially soft and thick microfibers chenille relieve pressure and fatigue on your feet. Each strand of the chenille material is soft to the touch and filled with a microfiber that is ultra soft. 🚿ADD A NON SLIP RUG PAD & MORE SAFER - One of the biggest questions you ask when purchasing a bath rug is, \"Will it stay in place?\" Compared with other backings, this bathroom rug's backing with updated version slip-resistant Hot melt spray backing keeps the rug mats long-lasting and more durable. To keep you safer. This bathroom mat is added with a rug gripper separated from the rug, which can keep you or your family from slipping. [Note] Place rug on a CLEAN DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. 🚿MACHINE WASHABLE - Taking care of home products is always essential. The rugs are cleaned with a dryer under mild water temperature and detergent, and it looks like a new one after each cleaning. Very durable material, the color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried. No worry about it getting the fibers off, it's really easy to handle and care for, which can make your busy life easier. 🚿FIT MANY OCCASIONS - Size in 20\"x32\" bath mat fit for variety place: bathtub, shower, bedroom, toilet, restroom, kitchen, living room, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HFICzAEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEIDEAS","source_asin":"B08C5BGGLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C5BGGLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C5BGGLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324333,"name":"Cheftop Induction Cooktop Portable Induction Burners 120V Digital Ceramic Top with Kids Safety Lock,1800 Watt, Touch Sensor Control Multiple Cooking Z","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":135.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OF0jyJntL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TWO ZONE INDUCTION COOKTOP: This Professional Digital Countertop 2 Burner Induction Cooktop features 2 Circular Top Panel Heating Zones with Independent Temperature Zone Setting & a Digital LCD Display Screen MULTIPLE COOKING MODES: Switch from one cooking mode to another w/ just one digital press. Enjoy the benefits of manual cooking function with fry, steam, & water mode for easy cooking, as well as an automatic warm function which keeps the food warm for serving later. SAFETY LOCK FUNCTION: The Cheftop induction cooktop 2 burner is also equipped with a Built in Child Safety Lock securing and locking all operating buttons of the dual induction cooktop in order to protect the little ones from injuries such as scalding. ENERGY EFFICIENT: The induction cooktop dual burner uses 120v that cooks food by through electromagnets. That means that no heat is lost between the cooking surface & the pot. The Cheftop Induction cooktop process makes it highly energy efficient & it makes cooking a lot easier & faster and fun. COMPATIBLE MAGNETIC COOKWARE: The dual induction cooktop works with magnetic induction cookware like cast iron, iron, steel, and enameled iron cookware. The auto-pan detection will shut the unit off automatically after 60 seconds if no cookware, or the incorrect cookware is detected. Lightweight & compact, great for home / outdoor cooking & its easy to clean MODERN APPERANCE: Black ceramic glass plate, compact and built-in design, it takes up minimal space under the counter. offers an attractive look for any small counter top kitchen area. HIGH POWER HEATING: Equipped with 9 heating level settings, quickly choose your desired power from 300W to 1800W power to meet your various cooking needs; simmer, steam, sear, slow cook, deep fry, boil, and grill with ease. TIMER FUNCTION: To set the timer in 1-minute increments and ranges from 1 to 99 minutes for any cooking zone that shuts down automatically to avoid overcook. Enjoy easy cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OF0jyJntL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DRINKPOD","source_asin":"B09238VV8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09238VV8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09238VV8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
