window.products.push({"id":324374,"name":"Zassenhaus Berlin 11.8-Inch Dark Stained Beech Pepper Mill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a0OWo7rjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zassenhaus began in 1867 as an export store supplying small steel goods and hand tools. Then in 1904, the foundation for the future success was laid with the introduction of pepper mills. In 2000 Zassenhaus invented the first continuously adjustable grinding mechanism made from high quality German ceramic. Zassenhaus products are distinctive and unique and solidify our position as the leading supplier of premium spice and coffee mills. A mill is as good as its grinding mechanism as this alone determines how much flavor and aroma is released when the spices are ground. Zassenhaus patented German ceramic mechanism is for peppercorns, sea salt, spices and dried herbs. Each mill features six different adjustments from rough to fine grind. The classic 11.8-inch tall Berlin Salt Mill features Zassenhaus' patented CeraPlus(R) German ceramic grinding mechanism that's actually harder than carbon steel. And unlike steel, whose blades corrode from exposure to salt and become dull over time, the CeraPlus grinding mechanism is guaranteed for 25 years of flawless service. Simply twist the 6-position bottom dial to adjust the fineness or coarseness of the grind. To fill, simply unscrew the top knob. Lathe-turned from solid beechwood in a dark stained finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a0OWo7rjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zassenhaus","source_asin":"B09SQ3SDFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SQ3SDFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SQ3SDFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
