window.products.push({"id":324400,"name":"Deenkee Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo, 3000PA Suction, 180 Mins Runtime, 3500 mAh 3-in-1 Robotit Vacuum Cleaner, Gyroscope Navigation 3.0, WiFi/App/Alexa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AxZzUawdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3000 PA Strong Suction Power & Ultra Quiete】- The Upgraded 3000 PA suction power with 3 suction modes and a special carpet Auto-boost mode can easily pick up dust, pet hair, and crumbs on the hard floor and carpets. Side Brushes take care of corners and edges. With an upgraded motor, the D40 robotic vacuum cleans every bit of dirt while maintaining quiet operation. Ideal for families with kids and pets. 【180 Mins Long Life Battery & Self Charging】- With the upgraded battery, the running time of Deenkee D40 robot vacuum is increased by 50%, and the maximum running time is increased to 180 minutes, which means that even large houses can be cleaned in one go. D40 will return to charging base automatically at the end of a cleaning cycle or when its battery is running low. *Please fully charge the robot vacuum for 5~6 hours before first use 【Smart 3-IN-1 Vacuuming & Mopping & Sweeping】- D40 Robot vacuums provides Sweeping & Vacuuming & Mopping functions.A 300ml intelligent control water tank is provided with low, medium, and high water volume modes. You can adjust the water volume via APP. Note: Do not fill the water tank with too much water, it is recommended to fill 2/3 volume to avoid water leakage. 【WIFI & APP & Alexa & Google Assistant】 - Designed for those who like easy operation, Deenkee D40 works with APP Alexa and Google Assistant. You can set a cleaning schedule, change cleaning modes easily via DEENKEE APP or start and stop cleaning by voice commands via Alexa. It is easy to install the APP and connect to Alexa and Google Assistant. DEENKEE robot vacuum cleaner packed with APP install manual. 【Upgraded Gyroscope Navigation 3.0】- Deenkee D40 robot vacuum cleaner fully upgraded the Navigation System, newly added path tracking optical flow sensor, saves 50% cleaning time and increases cleaning coverage by 20%. Upgraded Gyroscope Navigation Cleans in an \"S\"-shaped path, double efficiency compared to standard robot vacuum cleaners, helping you clean your house deeper and faster. 【6 Cleaning Modes & AutoBoost Technology】- Deenkee Robotic Vacuum provides 6 cleaning modes including Auto/Random/Single Room/Spot/Edge/Scheduled Cleaning. You can customize your cleaning routine for a better clean. The robot vacuum cleaner auto-adjust Cleaning Head and increases suction power when clean carpets to get the best clean. 【2.75\"Slim Body &Anti-drop Sensor】 - With slim 2.75\" body, D40 robotic vacuum can slides under bed, sofa, and other furniture for a thoroughly clean. Anti-drop sensors prevent the robot vacuum from falling down stairs. NOTE: Anti-dropping sensors may work less effectively if the robot used on reflective/very dark-colored floors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AxZzUawdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deenkee","source_asin":"B08FSKFSWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSKFSWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSKFSWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
