window.products.push({"id":324422,"name":"Florensi Meditation Mat Zabuton, Velvet Floor Cushions for Sitting, Meditation Cushions and Pillows with 100% Cotton Insert, Yoga Cushion for Women an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xugorTiXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEDITATE LONGER & MORE COMFORTABLY: Our meditation pillow mat allows you to meditate for longer periods of time. This square zabuton cushion provides maximum comfort and support for you when sitting or kneeling, These cushions are 32” wide and 3” thick for your meditation and yoga practices. PAIRS WITH FLORENSI CUSHIONS & BENCHES: Our zabutons work well with our zafus and meditation benches to provide total support and stability for moments of mindfulness or restorative yoga. Enjoy less stress on your joints, relieve lower back pain, and reduce any tingling or numbness in your hands and feet. FLOOR PILLOW SEATING: Our Japanese-style mats are made of an ultra-soft velvet cover that is skin-friendly and machine washable. Available in a range of colors and embroidered with a beautiful gold accent, these sleek and modern meditation cushions look great in an office, yoga room, meditation space or as a decorative accent anywhere in your home. VERSATILE USE - A favorite chair of practitioners of Zen Buddhist meditation and prayer, this extra soft mat is also used as a yoga prop to help ease you into certain poses. Great for those in search of a spacious, comfy sitting pillow for relaxation and rest, or ideal to use as a floor pillow or chair at home for working/learning. These mats also make a thoughtful gift for mother’s day or a parent’s birthday. THE FLORENSI PROMISE - We feel passionate that yoga and meditation play a crucial role in health and well-being. Through our line of products we strive to promote physical well-being and encourage oneness by connecting the self with nature, resulting in a society full of joy and good health. If you have any trouble, please let us know - we’d be delighted to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xugorTiXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Florensi","source_asin":"B088BVW22L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088BVW22L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088BVW22L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
