window.products.push({"id":324426,"name":"Stainless Steel Potato Ricer and Masher with 3 Interchangeable Disc＆Vegetables Masher (M)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xi8HvkdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This tool is suitable for all types of potatoes such as sweet potato mash, purple mash and yam mash. A kitchen utensil that can be used as a noodle maker, noodle strainer, fruit press, pasta press, cendol maker and pumpkin masher. The dense and regular holes make it easier to squeeze out fine and smooth mashed potatoes and juice. Give it a try, you'll find it's great for cooked apples, cauliflower, yams, carrots, beans... especially handy for making homemade baby food. Suitable for Soft Juicy Fruit such as watermelon, oranges, lemons, grapes, strawberries, kiwifruits, pomegranates. How to Use? Wash the ricer in warm soapy water and dry thoroughly before first use. Step 1: Boil the unpeeled potatoes for about 15 minutes or until they are soft enough to break up by pressed with a fork. Step 2: Prepare your potato ricer and a cooking pot/bowl, fill the hopper with a few chunks of potatoes. Step 3: Hold the ricer over the waiting pot/bowl, squeeze the handle down with easy, it shall force through the smooth mashed potatoes with the skin stuck to the plunger/bottom of the cup,then it's super easy to remove the potato skin. Kindly Remind: Do not fill potatoes upto the top\" can help to squeeze more easily, cut potatoes into medium or smaller pieces if they are in large size. Color: stainless steel primary color / black silicone Size: 29.5 * 9 * 11.5cm (11.6in * 3.54 *4.5) Weight: 580g (1.27ib) Uses: Pressing mashed potatoes, pressing juice, baking and other functions Material: 304s / 430s Packing: box packaging Dimensions Overall length :30cm(11.8in) Overall Width : 10cm(3.9 in) Overall Depth :11.5cm (4.5in) Packing List： 1PC x Potato ricer 3PCS x changeable discs 2pc x Microwave Potato Pocket","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xi8HvkdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anweike","source_asin":"B082ZQR2V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082ZQR2V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082ZQR2V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324427,"name":"ARCOS Paring Knife 3 Inch Stainless Steel. Kitchen Knife for Peeling Fruits and Vegetables. Ergonomic Polyoxymethylene Handle and 75mm Blade. Series U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410DLY7BWUL._AC_SL1383_.jpg","description":"The 75 mm Universal series Paring knife is an ideal utensil for cleaning, cutting and chopping vegetables or fruits. It is an excellent companion when preparing food. It provides a firm and smooth cut that fits perfectly in your hand while chopping, slicing or cutting any type of vegetable or fruit. PRECISION AND DURABILITY: This Paring knife is made using a patented technique by Arcos called Nitrum, which provides increased durability, hardness, and high precision cutting. It is the result of shaping stainless steel with nitrogen to obtain a powerful and ultra-resistant tool. CLASSIC AND SAFE DESIGN: Handle designed for daily use without losing design, where straight lines with large formal contrasts and color predominate. It's made of polyoxymethylene (POM) so it is highly resistant to detergents and extreme temperature. It can be cleaned using chemicals and is suitable for the dishwasher. DIMENSIONS: This Paring knife measures 178 mm in length and weighs 68 grams. Size Blade: 75 mm | 3” Inch making it a great tool for all your kitchen cutting needs. Arcos: A family-owned business with a legacy of craftsmanship dating back to 1734. Almost three centuries of research and continuous improvement of our products make Arcos an international benchmark in the cutlery sector. From Albacete, Spain, we produce 11,000,000 knives every year that combine knowledge, design and innovation in order to achieve the highest quality standards. We distribute our unique pieces in over 70 countries around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410DLY7BWUL._AC_SL1383_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARCOS","source_asin":"B0C2ZD5X4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2ZD5X4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2ZD5X4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
