window.products.push({"id":324459,"name":"MacKenzie-Childs Courtly Check Enamel Grinder, Refillable Manual Salt Grinder and Pepper Grinder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":118.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z1JP-l2YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It doesn’t get more classic than Courtly Check. The MacKenzie-Childs Courtly Check Enamel Grinder is the perfect addition to your kitchen collection. A nice, helpful hand in the kitchen, this reusable empty spice grinder or peppercorn holder is ready to accent your every creation. It’s designed for use with whole peppercorns or coarse salt and features ceramic gears that have excellent mechanics and are built to last.This black-and-white season grinder is ready to add flavor to any setting (not just food!) and features a subtle shade palette woven by an artisan’s brush through glossy hand-painted checks. It perfectly matches the other kitchen tools and dishware in our Courtly Check collection, including tea kettles, pitchers, cups, bowls, plates, shakers, and more!You’ll never have to guess what to get for a housewarming gift now that you’re a part of the MacKenzie-Childs family. Our artisan-designed enamel pitchers and kitchenware pieces are the perfect gifts for any special people in your life. Since 1983, our talented designers and artisans have created beautiful original tableware, furniture, home decor, garden accessories, and more that add joy and grace to homes great and small throughout the world.Care instructions: Wipe clean with a soft damp cloth. Materials: Hand-glazed heavy-gauge steel underbody with hand-painted Courtly Check decoration and rolled edge. Pieces may vary due to the handmade nature of each product. Imported. Our enamelware exceeds both federal food-safety regulations and California’s Proposition 65, the strictest environmental safety standards in the United States. Handle enamelware with care and discontinue use for food service if it becomes chipped, cracked, or broken. Dimensions: 2 1/2\" dia. x 7\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z1JP-l2YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MACKENZIE-CHILDS","source_asin":"B0C5N97GKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5N97GKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5N97GKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324460,"name":"4Pcs Shower Curtain Sets with Rugs Black Grey Bathroom Curtain Sets Ombre White Shower Curtains for Bathroom with Non Silp Rug Toilet Lid Cover Bath M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zDJccQLoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPERB MATERIAL】:Rhombus plaid shower curtain is made of high quality polyester.It is waterproof and durable. The remaining 3 pieces are made of flannel. They are very soft and warm with excellent slip resistance, making it an excellent choice for your bathroom. 【HD PRINTING】:The classic HD rhombus plaid print adds an artistic vibe to your bathroom, and the pleasant and comfortable feeling makes you love to enjoy your bathing time. It can also be a beautiful decoration for other interior spaces when you need it. 【SIZES INFORMATION】:The rhombus plaid shower curtain size: 70.8\" L × 70.8\" W, the bathroom rug size: 29.5\" L × 17.7\" W, the U shape rug size: 17.7\" L × 14.8\" W, the toilet lid cover size: 17.7\" L × 13.8\" W. This bathroom sets size is suitable for most bathrooms. 【EASY INSTALLATION】:We will give 12 free quality hooks as a gift. You can easily install the shower curtain in any suitable position. It only takes a short time to refresh your bathroom. 【EXCELLENT SERVICE】 : You will get 1*Rhombus Plaid Shower Curtain, 1* Non-Slip Rug, 1*U-shaped Mat, 1*Toilet Lid Cover, 12*Hooks. Our professional customer service will serve you wholeheartedly. If you have any questions about our products, please contact us. We will solve your problem as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zDJccQLoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chrainy","source_asin":"B0B3XBDQVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XBDQVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XBDQVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324461,"name":"Swaying Skirt - Hawaiian Hula Dancer in Ti Leaf Skirt - Vintage Sepia Toned Photograph by Alan Houghton c.1960s - Master Art Print 9in x 12in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mrX0aTbcL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Alan Houghton - Alan Houghton (-2009) is an International, award-winning Photographic Artist. Alan has been a photographer for more than half a century, twenty years of which he spent in Hollywood. Hollywood was the base from which he traveled all over the globe (27 countries), photographing actresses and models for newspapers and magazines. His work has appeared on over three hundred magazine covers, and portraits of celebrities. London born, Alan has also had his own portrait studio in Vancouver, Canada, did some acting in Rome, Italy, and was the co-creator of an NBC television series in 1992. After regular visits to Hawaii during the seventies, he became enthralled by the beauty and culture of the islands, and moved to Honolulu with his wife, Jean. During this time he created an award winning collection of the hula kahiko (ancient hula). 72 pieces of this portfolio hang at the ‘Kahala Mandarin Oriental Hotel’ in Honolulu. Alan is unusual in that he is one of a dying breed of artisans. He hand makes all of his Fine Art Photographs himself, in his own darkroom in the traditional manner and personally signs them. But for a relaxing hobby he likes nothing more than photographing the beautiful female nude body. A selection of 16 pieces have been acquired by the ‘Rare Collections Library’ at the University of Hawaii. Alan favored the traditional artisan way of photography. He hand made all of his Fine Art Photographs himself, in his own darkroom. Besides the hula and glamor photography Alan enjoyed photographing the nude female body. Alan was a creative and kind man with a great sense of humor. He is missed but his work will live on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mrX0aTbcL._AC_SL1073_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B007TCDIN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007TCDIN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007TCDIN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
