window.products.push({"id":324526,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, Electric Beverage Warmer for Home or Office, Candle Wax or Hot Tea with Thermostat Gravity Switch and Timer - (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aZQpERvOL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Keep your coffee warm all day with this desktop coffee mug warmer. Don't worry about accidentally leaving it on because it turns off when it hasn't been used for five minutes. Adjustable at two different temperature levels, you can choose your ideal temperature preference. Includes timer settings between 1 and 9 hours giving you a constant temperature for the entire work day! Wait there's more! Use this as a candle warmer to fill your home or office with your favorite aroma. Don't worry about spills or messes because the glass surface is waterproof and spill proof. Use flat bottom cup for best and most efficient results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aZQpERvOL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solid Coffee Roasters","source_asin":"B09PQHHDC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PQHHDC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PQHHDC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324527,"name":"Vyfipt Green Tea Mattress, Made in USA, 10 Inch Full Size Memory Foam Mattress, Bamboo Cover, Bed in a Box, CertiPUR-US Certified, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xCrUIevdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MADE IN USA】This mattress is manufactured in South Carolina and Arizona Factory with unparalleled quality control you can trust. Mattresses designed by Vyfipt undergo 115 quality tests which contain 80,000 cycles of Foam Performance Testing and 100,000 cycles of Mattress Durability Testing. Passed the Oeko-Tex Standard 100 and CertiPur-US certification. 【3:7 Golden Ratio Builds Your Deep Sleep System for Medium feel】Lying on this mattress, you will feel very relaxed. The 3-inch green tea gel infused foam above can disperse the pressure of the body and will not compress the blood vessels, and the 7-inch support Foam below can support your body powerfully. This golden-ratio combination disperses stress from your body without letting you feel trapped and you'll feel your head, neck, shoulders, back, waist, hips, legs are treated gently. No matter what kind of sleeping position, the spine can always be a perfect curve. 【Internally and Externally BREATHABLE】Bamboo Cover Outside & Green Tea Gel Inside For Refreshing Sleep. This Removable Bamboo Knit Cover creates a cooling sensation that moves heat away from the body due to its superior breathability and temperature regulating properties. Green Tea Gel offers good airflow, dissipates heat, and wicks away excess moisture away from the body. These cooling technologies keep you cool and actively regulate temperature throughout the night. 【NONTEMPERATURE SENSITIVE TECHNOLOGY】As we all know, ordinary memory foam is hot in the summer and hard in texture in the winter and poor comfortability. Vyfipt non-temperature sensitive memory foam which is not affected by ambient temperature provides the most average and true support, makes the part contacted in length time of the body to be at the state of no pressure, not hinders the blood circulation and not easily produces fatigue and soreness. 【10 Year Warranty】Vyfipt mattresses are backed with a 10-year warranty. We are committed to providing the best service for every customer. If you have any problem, please contact us promptly and we are always at your service. Vyfipt memory foam mattress is compressed, rolled, and shipped in a box. For a better sleeping experience, please allow 24 hours at least for the mattress to fully expand. 【Supreme Support Performance】The bottom Flex Support Base Foam is strongly supportive. The maximum weight capacity is 600lbs except twin size (Twin mattress supports up to 300 lbs). 【70-Day Money-Back Guarantee】Besides a 10-year warranty, we provide a 70-day long free trial policy.If you feel it is not suitable for you, you can contact us for a refund. Generally, there will be a few days of adaptation period for the first use.After that, you will enjoy this amazing mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xCrUIevdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vyfipt","source_asin":"B0C667F9GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C667F9GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C667F9GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324528,"name":"Gold and White Swan Ballerina 100MM Musical Water Globe Plays Tune Swan Lake","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71omgYVnI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intricate detail and craftsmanship, this musical water globe is designed to add a touch of whimsey and fun to your home accents Pedestal base has classic bun feet and houses the wind-up mechanism that engages the music. Plays melodic tune Swan Lake Figurine inside water globe depicts rotating ballerina in white tutu with pink rose detail. Pedestal base is made of resin polymer stone material with dimensional white and red rose detail and gilded gold and pearl border surrounding embossed swans Lovely in design and measures approximately 6 inches in height and 4.5 inches in diameter. Great size for setting on a table top or displaying in a shelf arrangement Carefully packaged in a fitted box for easy gifting and storage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71omgYVnI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elanze Designs","source_asin":"B07WDYMGHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WDYMGHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WDYMGHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324529,"name":"Sculpted Magnet: Hey Sister I Want You to Know, 3.0\" x 3.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91miMummT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With their vibrant, contemporary colors and thoughtful words from some of America's most loved authors, Blue Mountain Arts Sculpted Magnets are a perfect way to let the special people in your life know just how much they are loved and appreciated. Each carefully crafted magnet is fashioned of sturdy, durable resin and features a variety of embellishments, 3-dimensional carvings or cut-outs that make each one truly unique; for added visual interest, the background colors of each magnet are gently swirled to create a lovely marble-like appearance. And, with themes that include family, friendship, relationships, encouragement, love and more, they're the perfect addition to any card or gift or just as a spur-of-the-moment purchase to brighten someone's day! Since 1971, Blue Mountain Arts has been helping people communicate their deepest, most sincere thoughts and feelings about love, friendship, family, ideals and dreams. The Colorado-based company founded by poet Susan Polis Schutz and physicist/illustrator Stephen Schutz is known world-wide for its innovative art styles, quality paper and ever-increasing selection of authors, artists, and product lines. The same quality and high standards established with the very first Blue Mountain Arts products continue today to make them standouts in the marketplace, filling a very unique and necessary need ... that of helping people communicate their feelings and connect with the special people in their lives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91miMummT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Mountain Arts","source_asin":"B00G6S3ODU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6S3ODU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G6S3ODU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
