window.products.push({"id":324661,"name":"Porthos Home Abella Nesting Accent Club Chair with Foot Stool, PU Leather Upholstery, Ergonomic Low Back and Armrest (Space-Saving Design is Suitable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cn7zvYVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Porthos Home Abella club chair - smart solution for cozy corners When space is of a premium, accent room chairs like the Abella cleverly balances space constraint, functionality and style. Space-saving nesting design Now you see the foot stool, then you don’t. The Abella barrel chair is a space illusionist of sorts. Conveniently pull out the foot stool when you need an extra seat or just want to kick back and relax by the end of the day. Push it back and you’ll instantly free up floor space. Lots of functional versatility, isn’t it? Water and stain resistant PU leather upholstery You’ll never have to manage unsightly blotches on the Abella tub chair as its PU leather can effectively repel drips and dirt. Popcorn, ice cream or pizza, Netflix and the Abella sitting chair - it’s a classic combo. Sleek, elegant design Featuring a timeless design with clean, fluid lines, the Abella club chairs are style chameleons that can blend easily into any corner of the house or office. You’ll always have space for an accent chair like the Abella because it really doesn’t take up too much space. Features of Porthos Home Abella PU leather club chair: Space-saving nesting design with pull-out foot stool Water and stain resistant PU leather upholstery Ergonomic design Easy-to-match neutral colors Dimensions: big - (height) 30.3 x (width) 27.2 x (length/depth) 22 inches; small - (height) 12.6 x (width) 18.11 x (length/depth) 14.17 inches Weight: 30.86 lbs 1-year warranty for your peace of mind Your satisfaction is important to us. That’s why we offer a 1-year warranty on the Porthos Home Abella PU leather chairs for living room so you can get timely help if you’ve issues with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cn7zvYVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porthos Home","source_asin":"B082CWWN4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082CWWN4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082CWWN4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324662,"name":"6Pcs Canning Bubble Popper Bubble Remover and Jar Magnetic Lid Lifter, Headspace Measurer Essential Canning Tool, Canning Supplies Starter Kit, Canner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FOsPEHdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★It’s important to de-bubble jars after filling them and before you put the lids on, to make sure there is no trapped air in the jar. ★Use this canning debubble tool in the edges of the jar to allow air to escape prior to sealing. Measure the head space in your canning jar to keep the jar from over-expanding during the canning process. ★A magnetic lid wand helps you to lift a metal lid out of boiling water without scalding yourself. Part of the idea was also that by not touching the lid with your fingers, it helped to keep the lid more sterile. ★One of the most important aspects of home canning is keeping everything germ free. The Canning Lid Lifter makes it easier, since clean lids help prevent any contaminants from getting into your food. ★100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – We proudly back your purchase with our exclusive satisfaction guarantee. If anything goes wrong with your new home canning supplies kit,contact us for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FOsPEHdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEONICE","source_asin":"B0B4PS71MQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4PS71MQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4PS71MQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324663,"name":"Twine Square Slate Coasters, Modern Square Coasters, Slate with Velvet Backing, Protect Tables and Surfaces, Black, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sVRgmETxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The reassuring hardness of glass lightly touching down on stone, the cool ring of moisture left on slate as your drink effortlessly rises to quench your thirst: these are as much a part of the experience of enjoying a relaxing moment as anything else. It's true that drink coasters are merely one part of the whole that includes great company and uplifting beverages. However, any experienced host or hostess knows that it's the details that sometimes matter most. This set of four 4\"x4\" coasters gives you the stylish landing you need to rest anything from a glass of wine to a frosty mug of beer, and it's this same versatility that makes them an excellent gift. Finding the best coasters for drinks is about more than style. There's practical necessity to coasters as well. Anyone who's ever had a plastic coaster hitch a ride on the bottom of a glass knows the frustration of a wet lap full of condensation and the shortcomings of some coasters. Slate has that rare combination of elegance and functionality. These coasters are beautiful, with natural-cut edges and deep, muted neutral tones that complement nearly any decor. They're also beneficiaries of some of the useful material properties of slate. Heft, of course, prevents the coaster from traveling where it isn't wanted. There's also a figurative weight: These coasters lend as much gravitas to a crystal glass of scotch as they give stony authenticity to a draught of beer. The stone also absorbs significant moisture, allowing summer drinks to sweat excessively before the water pools out onto your surfaces. These coasters further protect your tables or countertops with a smooth layer of velvet backing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sVRgmETxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twine","source_asin":"B09RHSHTSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RHSHTSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RHSHTSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
