window.products.push({"id":324703,"name":"ZZQ Bento Box Adult Lunch box with Bag, 3-Tier Stainless Steel Insulated Thermal Compartment Food Container with Utensils, Leak-proof Stackable Lunch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dKO6ZFg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENCOURAGE HEALTHY EATING HABITS : This stackable bento lunch box is made from food grade safe PP (outer) and durable 304 stainless steel (inner), BPA and phlalate free, you can enjoy your meal without worry; Say goodbye to takeout and cheap disposable meal prep containers! You can bring it to work, school, gym, picnic, camping, etc; (age: over 8 years old) KEEP FOOD WARM CONTAINER - This thermal lunch box usually can keep food warm or cold for 2-3 hours,with the insulated lunch bag can keep for 3-4 hours. This will maintain temperature longer than lunch boxes with no insulation but does not provide thermoses-like warming; INCLUDES BENTO BOX ACCESSORIES - The insulated lunch bag is made of fashionable oxford fabric exterior and food-grade aluminum foil interior, which not only enhances the heat preservation time of the lunch box, but also makes it easy to carry. A free portable flatware set is also provided, which can be put into the lunch bag with the lunch box; this travel-friendly lunch box set to let you pack fresh fruit, vegetables, sandwiches, snacks, wraps, and more; LEAK & SPILL PROOF - Independent sealing design. Each layer of the thermal lunch box has a separate sealing cover, which can prevent sauce and soup from leaking, keep food warm and ensure that food will not touch the bottom of the upper layer. Perfect for students and adults to bring food to school, office, picnic, or anywhere. STACKABLE DESIGN- The stainless steel lunch box is designed to be stacked, you could freely combine them into 1, 2 or 3 layers lunch box to facilitate the storage of different amounts of food; Pack your main course, fresh salad, fruits, carrots or any snacks in the stackable lunch box suitable for kids to school, adults to work, exercise, camping and travel;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dKO6ZFg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZZQ","source_asin":"B0BWRJFN81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWRJFN81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWRJFN81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
