window.products.push({"id":324705,"name":"Durablow 8VK-TX340 Electronic Automatic Spark to Pilot Valve Kit with Thermostat, Backlit LCD, Variable Flame Height, Timer Remote for Natural Gas (NG","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WbFQT0V7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ IMPORTANT ★ For Natural Gas (NG) only. ★ For 18\" to 30\" vented log sets fireplace only. ▼ BOX INCLUDES: 8VK Valve Kit with Pilot Assembly, Pilot Brackets, Transmitter Remote Handset (TX340), Flex Line, Damper Clamp, 3/8\" to 1/2\" Flare Adapter, Instructions. ▼ FEATURES: (1) CSA certified & Made in TAIWAN; (2) Valve Kit measures 3.4”W x 5”D x 5.4”H, Smallest one-box design on market; (3) Thermostat & flame height setting from remote handset; (4) Patented “FORK” pilot brackets for quick mount; (5) Battery-powered. ▼ FEATURES: (6) Automatic electronic spark to pilot; (7) Childproof lock available; (8) A flip rocker switch on valve kit for manual ON/OFF emergency use; (9) Stainless steel #304 housing, thickness: 19 Gauge; (10) 1-Year Limited Warranty; (11) Backlit LCD display. ▼ BENEFITS: Add convenience to your life with the Durablow Valve Kit with Remote. No more smudging your clothes with soot or getting up to manually turn on the fireplace or adjust fire while in the middle of great conversation. Simply press buttons to ignite the fire & set thermostat, and watch the flames glow gently from your hearth. Enjoy safe, reliable, user-friendly control of gas heating appliances. ▼ CROSS REFERENCE #: AFVK-SP, AFVK-SP-MH-L, SPK-26, APK-28. ▼ COMPATIBLE with RH Peterson Real Fyre, Grand Canyon, White Mountain Hearth, Monessen, Everwarm, Superior, Hargrove, CleanBurn, Dreffco & more... gas log set brands. ▼ LEGAL DISCLAIMER: If your house is UNATTENDED, do NOT use any remote functions, and DO turn OFF main gas supply. Installation only by qualified technician or professional people.The Brand name & Model # (if listed) are for cross reference only. All Brands, Trademarks & Model Numbers remain the property of their respective owners. ▼ ABOUT DURABLOW: For decades, Durablow has been the top leader in the hearth industry by providing quality SMART HOME & RF fireplace remote controls, modules & gas valve kits. Durablow continues to help upgrade gas fireplaces running smarter and keep providing the heat and comfort, customers all expect, with more affordable prices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WbFQT0V7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Durablow","source_asin":"B09LQJYFSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQJYFSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQJYFSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
