window.products.push({"id":324760,"name":"Reetual XL Shower Mat Non Slip - 27x27 Bath Mat for Shower Stall or Large Bathtub Mat with 240 Powerful Suction Cups and Drain Holes. Black Shower Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ue6kB2jPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Extra Large In Shower Mat That Lets You Dance While You Sing!While shower trays have increased over time, sadly the poor shower mat square has not. But the forgotten hero of soapy sing-a-longs, “oops I dropped the soap” and romantic 2-person lathers is forgotten no more!Because this non slip shower mat has 65% more coverage.That’s an extra 6 inches each way! While other shower mats are 21 x 21in, this non slip mat for shower is 27 x 27in. So you can stand how you like; one person or two, or dancing around like no one’s watching!It Has Some Incredible Grip and Non-Slip Appeal, Too.Because we used a softer PVC, this bath mat shower square sticks to the shower floor better, while making sure your feet stay firmly planted, even in your soapiest moments. It features 240 Powerful Suction Cups that stick firmly to smooth surfaces (but not textured ones). It's also easy to remove, simply peel from one corner! The soft PVC top is textured with delightful little bumps that are non-slip and safe for elderly and kids.As For Drainage and Keeping Things Dry?Your nonslip shower mat has a central drainage system plus hundreds of tiny drain holes so your non skid shower mat is always hygienic every time you use it. And it’s machine washable, too! Easy to clean. Line Dry.* Extra Large 27 x 27in Stand Up Shower Mat. 65% MORE Coverage!* Stall Shower Mat with Drain Hole and Hundreds of Smaller Ones* Textured Surface and Soft PVC Non Slip Bath Shower Mat* 240 Powerful Suction Cups. But Easy To Remove* Free from Bad Odors and Extra Hygienic* Machine Washable, Line Dry* Easy To Fold For Storage* Soft PVC Rubber MatYour xl shower non slip mat will arrive folded. Leave it flat for 1-2 days and the fold lines will disappear. Harder mats can’t say the same. Available in a range of colors, choose your NEW XL Shower Mat and order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ue6kB2jPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reetual","source_asin":"B093J6SRR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093J6SRR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093J6SRR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
