window.products.push({"id":324765,"name":"Baxton Studio Plumelle Chest, Oak Brown/Dark Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":224.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ey8de4HTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The plumelle drawer chest will add a chic yet effortless look to your space. The mid-century inspired-design elements include an emphasis on the Chest's clean, rectangular silhouette and use of color. The plumelle's engineered wood frame is finished in a light oak brown for a fresh, natural look. The chest features grey finished vertical drawer handles for a unique, understatedly sophisticated style. The plumelle's five drawers are inset, and the chest Stands on delightfully angled, tapered legs. Refresh your bedroom or guest room with this tasteful, modern chest. Made in Malaysia, the plumelle require assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ey8de4HTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B07FGP195P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FGP195P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FGP195P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":324766,"name":"SCULPFUN Laser Cutting Honeycomb Working Table Board for CO2 or Diode Laser Engraver Cutting Machine, for Slight Burnt & Smooth Edge Cutting, Visible ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Kbv5gDNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Necessary Accessories for Laser Cutting: After using this laser cutting honeycomb table to cut wood, acrylic and other materials, the edges of the materials are neat and clean, not easily burnt by laser or yellowed by smoke, so you can get a nice cutting work. Cutting Through Observable Design: We add 4 height increase pads for easy view. When the laser cuts through wood or acrylic, the metal plate at the bottom of the honeycomb will emit a bright light, which means that the cutting has penetrated. Solve the problem that ordinary engraving machine is difficult to judge whether cutting through. High Quality Full-Metal Structure：SCULPFUN honeycomb table is made of metal, processed by high-precision CNC, it’s strong, stable, rust-proof, durable and high flatness. Safe Metal Pad & Precise Scale Lines: Comes with a metal pad to protect the table from laser damage. A right angle measuring scale on the X and Y axes allows easy and quick measurement of the cutting object. Wide Compatibility: Compatible with various laser engraving machines, such as diode DIY laser engraving machine and CO2 laser engraving machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Kbv5gDNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCULPFUN","source_asin":"B0C2C94547","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2C94547","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2C94547","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
