window.products.push({"id":324965,"name":"Personalized Scottie Dog Bone Ornaments for Christmas Tree - Polyresin Scottie Dog Ornaments - Cutest Scottie Gifts for All Scottie Lovers and Owners ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cjc7FoiCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Ornaments – unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our personalized Scottie ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and realistic features of a playful miniature Scottie dog on a white dog bone. Get ready for some serious puppy love this Christmas with our personalized Scottie ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – unlike other personalized Christmas ornaments that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every 2022 realistic Scottie dog ornaments for Christmas trees is hand painted to ensure your little Scottie dog is a one-of-a-kind furry friend you’ll cherish forever. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – add a charming keepsake to your holiday tree décor collection and cherish your family’s best furry friend. Give your pet dog a special place on the Christmas tree with these unique Christmas ornaments that are sure to bring smiles to your family’s face. Hand painted and crafted with festive lifelike details, vibrant colors, and customized to your exact specifications – your Scottie Christmas decorations 2022 will make your Christmas tree feel extra special. 24 Hour Order Processing – Custom personalized and ready for gifting or hanging on the tree with the attached ribbon. Your personalized dog Christmas gifts arrive nestled in tissue paper with a gift box, giftbag, and gift tag – no need for wrapping! Give the ideal dog gift of joy this Holiday season to the dog lover or pet parent – or as a memorial gift for remembrance of a beloved furry friend. Happy and Satisfied Dog Lovers - At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful and unique dog gifts for dog lovers and families to celebrate the Holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your Scottie decorations, let us know and we’ll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cjc7FoiCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07GB1NXFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GB1NXFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GB1NXFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
