window.products.push({"id":324999,"name":"O.HSNYIU 2 PCS Replacement Bed Support Legs, Adjustable 7.08\"-13\" Bed Frame Support Legs, Metal Bed Frame Legs Replacement, Adjustable Height Center S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6ZH+cu4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BED SUPPORT LEGS: Without proper center support, the weight of the mattress will cause the wooden slats to bend or break. The bed frame leg replacement can provide the necessary support for the wooden slats to protect your bed and mattress from sagging and damage. Central slat support legs, no need to downgrade your mattress or give up your favorite bed frame. Suitable for most bed frames. EASY INSTALLATION: Installation steps: (1)Prepare screwdrivers and wrench. (2) ① Bed frame has holes, fix the positions and holes to be installed; ② Bed frame has no holes, use the feet and the bed frame to place it in a crisscross style, place the plate on the corresponding bracket on the bed frame, clamp the bed frame. (3)Align the screws with the holes and tighten them. (4)Adjust the height by manually rotating the bed support legs. T- shaped feet, no punching, easy to install. SIZE/LOAD: The minimum height of each bed support legs is 7.08 inch (18cm), the longest can be adjusted to 13 inch (33cm), and the adjustable height range is very large. The total load bearing capacity of the 4 furniture legs can reach about 300kg (661lbs). If You are considering upgrading the furniture in your home, these furniture legs will be a good choice for you.The size is measured by hand, there may be a slight error, thank you for your understanding. METAL MATERIAL: These bed frame legs are made of high quality cold rolled steel, the surface is painted to prevent rust, which has the characteristics of strong and durable / not easy to deform / strong bearing capacity / not easy to rust. And the bottom of the adjustable bed legs adopts a thickened non-slip base, which can ensure that the ground is not scratched and reduce noise. PACKAGE LIST: Adjustable bed support legs X 2, Mounting Screws X 4, NutsX 4, Mounting Plate X 2. No extra trips to the Hardware Store. If you find the product is damaged or missing parts, please contact us for a free replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6ZH+cu4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O.HSNYIU","source_asin":"B0BYPB8G8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-324999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYPB8G8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYPB8G8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
